Chain Store Quest turns everyday chain stores into a light quest across the city.

Pick convenience stores, cafés, and other familiar chains on the map, stitch them into a route, and treat ordinary errands as a small collection game. It’s less a sightseeing guide and more an experiment in making daily movement feel playful.

• Find chain stores on the map and build a simple route  
• Log stops as quest progress or a personal collection  
• Works in the browser—no app install required  
• Storage follows the live service rules (see in-app notes for accounts)

A tiny web toy for turning the walk home into a mild adventure.
